      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What is the work around exactly? I've been struggling and finding no resources on this at all. I'm trying with and without deferred shading. That works in the editor but it stops working when I test in VRChat. I just want to access the depth buffer, this should be a billion steps it should be a pointer reference...  I don't know what to do, it feels like VRChat turns on and off a bunch of stuff and it hides everything (like why is their mirror code hidden in a DLL?). I can't work like this.\n\nEven 'turning on' depth for a different camera seems to do nothing at all. I'm at my wits end and this is pushing me to maybe start a vrc competitor and I'm not even joking, it'd be less work than this.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
